<title>POLAND: Bourse suspends Espebepe trade Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Bourse suspends Espebepe trade Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Stock Exchange suspended trade in construction company Espebepe SA on Tuesday because the firm incorrectly fulfilled information requirements, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Espebepe failed to publish its April earnings report on Monday as scheduled and reported earnings on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
